{"id":"vol9-01","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-01/audio-2.m4a","model":"small","duration":405.0,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.28,"text":"Now turn to section 2 on page 3.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.3],["turn",0.3,0.58],["to",0.58,0.82],["section",0.82,1.06],["2",1.06,1.68],["on",1.68,2.36],["page",2.36,2.66],["3.",2.66,3.28]]},{"start":5.65,"end":6.47,"text":"Section 2.","words":[["Section",5.65,5.87],["2.",5.87,6.47]]},{"start":7.73,"end":12.49,"text":"You will hear a teacher giving a talk about a junior school to a group of parents.","words":[["You",7.73,7.89],["will",7.89,8.07],["hear",8.07,8.29],["a",8.29,8.47],["teacher",8.47,8.81],["giving",8.81,9.25],["a",9.25,9.49],["talk",9.49,9.79],["about",9.79,10.15],["a",10.15,10.37],["junior",10.37,10.61],["school",10.61,11.17],["to",11.17,11.49],["a",11.49,11.65],["group",11.65,11.85],["of",11.85,12.01],["parents.",12.01,12.49]]},{"start":13.57,"end":19.19,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 11 to 17 on page 3.","words":[["First",13.57,14.15],["you",14.15,14.35],["have",14.35,14.51],["some",14.51,14.65],["time",14.65,15.03],["to",15.03,15.27],["look",15.27,15.39],["at",15.39,15.53],["questions",15.53,15.83],["11",15.83,16.37],["to",16.37,16.65],["17",16.65,17.19],["on",17.19,18.25],["page",18.25,18.61],["3.",18.61,19.19]]},{"start":44.63,"end":48.89,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 17.","words":[["Now",44.63,44.97],["listen",44.97,45.33],["carefully",45.33,45.85],["and",45.85,46.47],["answer",46.47,46.95],["questions",46.95,47.37],["11",47.37,48.05],["to",48.05,48.33],["17.",48.33,48.89]]},{"start":52.48,"end":54.86,"text":"Okay! Can everybody hear me?","words":[["Okay!",52.48,53.16],["Can",53.68,53.92],["everybody",53.92,54.24],["hear",54.24,54.68],["me?",54.68,54.86]]},{"start":54.86,"end":63.12,"text":"me? Good. Well, I'd like to welcome all the new parents to Spring Down Junior School. My","words":[["me?",54.86,54.96],["Good.",55.54,56.18],["Well,",56.78,57.22],["I'd",57.46,57.78],["like",57.78,57.92],["to",57.92,58.1],["welcome",58.1,58.5],["all",58.5,59.0],["the",59.0,59.2],["new",59.2,59.4],["parents",59.4,59.88],["to",59.88,60.38],["Spring",60.38,60.8],["Down",60.8,61.2],["Junior",61.2,61.58],["School.",61.58,62.0],["My",62.78,63.12]]},{"start":63.12,"end":70.08,"text":"name is Anne Rawson, and I'm the assistant head teacher. What I'd like to do is tell","words":[["name",63.12,63.36],["is",63.36,63.78],["Anne",63.78,64.3],["Rawson,",64.3,64.82],["and",65.22,65.5],["I'm",65.5,65.76],["the",65.76,65.88],["assistant",65.88,66.3],["head",66.3,66.68],["teacher.",66.68,67.08],["What",67.96,68.5],["I'd",68.5,68.72],["like",68.72,68.82],["to",68.82,69.0],["do",69.0,69.24],["is",69.24,69.7],["tell",69.7,70.08]]},{"start":70.08,"end":75.78,"text":"you about the school day and show you round the school, and perhaps you can ask me any","words":[["you",70.08,70.3],["about",70.3,70.52],["the",70.52,70.8],["school",70.8,71.04],["day",71.04,71.4],["and",71.4,72.24],["show",72.24,72.6],["you",72.6,72.78],["round",72.78,73.12],["the",73.12,73.32],["school,",73.32,73.78],["and",74.02,74.52],["perhaps",74.52,74.88],["you",74.88,75.08],["can",75.08,75.2],["ask",75.2,75.42],["me",75.42,75.6],["any",75.6,75.78]]},{"start":75.78,"end":82.98,"text":"questions you may have at the end. Right. First of all, let me start by telling you","words":[["questions",75.78,76.28],["you",76.28,76.62],["may",76.62,76.76],["have",76.76,77.08],["at",77.08,77.24],["the",77.24,77.38],["end.",77.38,77.7],["Right.",79.0,79.64],["First",80.2,80.5],["of",80.5,80.68],["all,",80.68,80.88],["let",81.12,81.24],["me",81.24,81.38],["start",81.38,81.94],["by",81.94,82.44],["telling",82.44,82.72],["you",82.72,82.98]]},{"start":82.98,"end":86.46,"text":"a little bit about what happens here and what's on offer.","words":[["a",82.98,83.14],["little",83.14,83.28],["bit",83.28,83.44],["about",83.44,83.68],["what",83.68,83.98],["happens",83.98,84.54],["here",84.54,84.88],["and",84.88,85.62],["what's",85.62,86.06],["on",86.06,86.18],["offer.",86.18,86.46]]},{"start":87.48,"end":95.44,"text":"Children are expected to arrive at school between 8.45 and 8.50 and the bell is rung for","words":[["Children",87.48,88.2],["are",88.2,88.68],["expected",88.68,89.08],["to",89.08,89.46],["arrive",89.46,89.9],["at",89.9,90.18],["school",90.18,90.62],["between",90.62,91.24],["8",91.24,91.68],[".45",91.68,92.06],["and",92.06,92.7],["8",92.7,92.88],[".50",92.88,93.38],["and",93.38,94.18],["the",94.18,94.4],["bell",94.4,94.64],["is",94.64,94.82],["rung",94.82,95.16],["for",95.16,95.44]]},{"start":95.44,"end":101.02,"text":"everybody to go to their classrooms at 8.55 so that we can take the register.","words":[["everybody",95.44,95.86],["to",95.86,96.18],["go",96.18,96.34],["to",96.34,96.46],["their",96.46,96.62],["classrooms",96.62,97.16],["at",97.16,97.86],["8",97.86,98.26],[".55",98.26,98.88],["so",98.88,99.72],["that",99.72,99.86],["we",99.86,99.98],["can",99.98,100.16],["take",100.16,100.42],["the",100.42,100.56],["register.",100.56,101.02]]},{"start":102.08,"end":108.98,"text":"We then have assembly at 9 o'clock when the whole school meets in the hall for the head","words":[["We",102.08,102.44],["then",102.44,102.74],["have",102.74,103.0],["assembly",103.0,103.52],["at",103.52,104.16],["9",104.16,104.58],["o",104.58,104.7],["'clock",104.7,105.22],["when",105.22,105.94],["the",105.94,106.14],["whole",106.14,106.38],["school",106.38,106.7],["meets",106.7,107.16],["in",107.16,107.38],["the",107.38,107.48],["hall",107.48,107.86],["for",107.86,108.46],["the",108.46,108.62],["head",108.62,108.98]]},{"start":108.98,"end":110.42,"text":"to talk to the children.","words":[["to",108.98,109.3],["talk",109.3,109.7],["to",109.7,109.92],["the",109.92,110.02],["children.",110.02,110.42]]},{"start":110.42,"end":116.72,"text":"He may discuss what's happened in the news or something that is important for the school.","words":[["He",110.42,111.62],["may",111.62,111.76],["discuss",111.76,112.1],["what's",112.1,112.64],["happened",112.64,112.94],["in",112.94,113.16],["the",113.16,113.24],["news",113.24,113.78],["or",113.78,114.42],["something",114.42,114.88],["that",114.88,115.12],["is",115.12,115.22],["important",115.22,115.86],["for",115.86,116.22],["the",116.22,116.36],["school.",116.36,116.72]]},{"start":117.9,"end":122.28,"text":"Lessons run until 4pm with an hour for lunch.","words":[["Lessons",117.9,118.62],["run",118.62,119.02],["until",119.02,119.5],["4pm",119.5,120.4],["with",120.4,121.08],["an",121.08,121.2],["hour",121.2,121.62],["for",121.62,121.92],["lunch.",121.92,122.28]]},{"start":123.28,"end":129.36,"text":"Lunch is served in the canteen and children can bring their own packed lunch or a hot meal","words":[["Lunch",123.28,123.72],["is",123.72,123.92],["served",123.92,124.32],["in",124.32,124.56],["the",124.56,124.66],["canteen",124.66,125.18],["and",125.18,125.92],["children",125.92,126.24],["can",126.24,126.6],["bring",126.6,126.84],["their",126.84,127.1],["own",127.1,127.32],["packed",127.32,127.62],["lunch",127.62,128.06],["or",128.06,128.54],["a",128.54,128.78],["hot",128.78,129.06],["meal",129.06,129.36]]},{"start":129.36,"end":129.94,"text":"is available.","words":[["is",129.36,129.56],["available.",129.56,129.94]]},{"start":130.78,"end":135.04,"text":"They also have time to play outside and get some fresh air.","words":[["They",130.78,131.26],["also",131.26,131.52],["have",131.52,131.78],["time",131.78,132.08],["to",132.08,132.3],["play",132.3,132.56],["outside",132.56,133.02],["and",133.02,133.78],["get",133.78,134.0],["some",134.0,134.24],["fresh",134.24,134.56],["air.",134.56,135.04]]},{"start":136.1,"end":142.04,"text":"In the middle of the morning and the middle of the afternoon, there are two breaks of","words":[["In",136.1,136.82],["the",136.82,137.02],["middle",137.02,137.3],["of",137.3,137.48],["the",137.48,137.58],["morning",137.58,137.92],["and",137.92,138.52],["the",138.52,138.76],["middle",138.76,138.96],["of",138.96,139.14],["the",139.14,139.24],["afternoon,",139.24,139.8],["there",140.3,140.6],["are",140.6,140.72],["two",140.72,141.08],["breaks",141.08,141.62],["of",141.62,142.04]]},{"start":142.04,"end":148.0,"text":"fifteen minutes, when the children also generally go outside, unless it's wet.","words":[["fifteen",142.04,142.54],["minutes,",142.54,143.12],["when",143.48,143.68],["the",143.68,143.8],["children",143.8,144.12],["also",144.12,144.5],["generally",144.5,145.1],["go",145.1,145.56],["outside,",145.56,146.34],["unless",146.8,147.36],["it's",147.36,147.74],["wet.",147.74,148.0]]},{"start":149.2,"end":155.84,"text":"Now, we encourage the children to do as much as they can, and we offer them several ways","words":[["Now,",149.2,149.9],["we",150.14,150.42],["encourage",150.42,150.92],["the",150.92,151.16],["children",151.16,151.54],["to",151.54,151.76],["do",151.76,151.96],["as",151.96,152.2],["much",152.2,152.56],["as",152.56,152.86],["they",152.86,153.02],["can,",153.02,153.54],["and",153.9,154.32],["we",154.32,154.5],["offer",154.5,154.68],["them",154.68,154.86],["several",154.86,155.3],["ways",155.3,155.84]]},{"start":155.84,"end":161.94,"text":"of achieving this. For example, on Thursday afternoons, rather than continuing with lessons,","words":[["of",155.84,156.02],["achieving",156.02,156.38],["this.",156.38,156.76],["For",157.4,157.6],["example,",157.6,158.0],["on",158.38,158.62],["Thursday",158.62,158.98],["afternoons,",158.98,159.7],["rather",160.02,160.32],["than",160.32,160.56],["continuing",160.56,161.16],["with",161.16,161.54],["lessons,",161.54,161.94]]},{"start":161.94,"end":169.52,"text":"regions, we expect the whole school to do sports. We vary these between summer and winter and","words":[["regions,",161.94,162.06],["we",162.48,162.76],["expect",162.76,163.2],["the",163.2,163.42],["whole",163.42,163.7],["school",163.7,164.18],["to",164.18,164.44],["do",164.44,164.64],["sports.",164.64,165.18],["We",165.92,166.6],["vary",166.6,167.04],["these",167.04,167.4],["between",167.4,167.78],["summer",167.78,168.26],["and",168.26,168.52],["winter",168.52,168.82],["and",168.82,169.52]]},{"start":169.52,"end":176.38,"text":"everything is supervised by the teachers. Also, we like the children to work on something","words":[["everything",169.52,170.0],["is",170.0,170.4],["supervised",170.4,170.86],["by",170.86,171.4],["the",171.4,171.58],["teachers.",171.58,171.96],["Also,",173.14,173.86],["we",174.2,174.52],["like",174.52,174.76],["the",174.76,174.92],["children",174.92,175.28],["to",175.28,175.48],["work",175.48,175.74],["on",175.74,176.04],["something",176.04,176.38]]},{"start":176.38,"end":183.18,"text":"artistic over a long period of time, so for each of the three terms, they are expected","words":[["artistic",176.38,177.2],["over",177.2,177.68],["a",177.68,177.96],["long",177.96,178.22],["period",178.22,178.64],["of",178.64,178.84],["time,",178.84,179.22],["so",179.74,180.06],["for",180.06,180.4],["each",180.4,180.68],["of",180.68,180.88],["the",180.88,181.02],["three",181.02,181.34],["terms,",181.34,181.86],["they",182.32,182.56],["are",182.56,182.7],["expected",182.7,183.18]]},{"start":183.18,"end":189.08,"text":"to produce a poster. This will normally be on something particular that they have studied","words":[["to",183.18,183.42],["produce",183.42,183.8],["a",183.8,184.32],["poster.",184.32,184.72],["This",185.56,185.98],["will",185.98,186.14],["normally",186.14,186.56],["be",186.56,186.76],["on",186.76,186.96],["something",186.96,187.3],["particular",187.3,187.9],["that",187.9,188.32],["they",188.32,188.5],["have",188.5,188.64],["studied",188.64,189.08]]},{"start":189.08,"end":195.94,"text":"that term, such as the environment. We also make sure we keep a close eye on how each","words":[["that",189.08,189.52],["term,",189.52,190.1],["such",190.36,190.7],["as",190.7,190.94],["the",190.94,191.1],["environment.",191.1,191.56],["We",192.84,193.16],["also",193.16,193.46],["make",193.46,193.7],["sure",193.7,193.94],["we",193.94,194.14],["keep",194.14,194.3],["a",194.3,194.44],["close",194.44,194.72],["eye",194.72,195.12],["on",195.12,195.32],["how",195.32,195.58],["each",195.58,195.94]]},{"start":195.94,"end":201.74,"text":"child is doing in their schoolwork, and every month, rather than the teacher giving the","words":[["child",195.94,196.42],["is",196.42,196.66],["doing",196.66,196.98],["in",196.98,197.24],["their",197.24,197.4],["schoolwork,",197.4,198.06],["and",198.44,198.94],["every",198.94,199.26],["month,",199.26,199.7],["rather",200.08,200.36],["than",200.36,200.58],["the",200.58,200.7],["teacher",200.7,201.12],["giving",201.12,201.48],["the",201.48,201.74]]},{"start":201.74,"end":208.58,"text":"children a report, as I know some schools do, they have to do tests, and we record","words":[["children",201.74,202.1],["a",202.1,202.26],["report,",202.26,202.76],["as",203.12,203.44],["I",203.44,203.76],["know",203.76,203.96],["some",203.96,204.22],["schools",204.22,204.62],["do,",204.62,204.9],["they",205.62,205.82],["have",205.82,206.1],["to",206.1,206.24],["do",206.24,206.46],["tests,",206.46,206.94],["and",207.44,207.84],["we",207.84,208.0],["record",208.0,208.58]]},{"start":208.58,"end":216.12,"text":"their performance over the year. We're very proud of our school, and of the very good","words":[["their",208.58,208.86],["performance",208.86,209.36],["over",209.36,210.08],["the",210.08,210.24],["year.",210.24,210.64],["We're",211.8,212.44],["very",212.44,212.8],["proud",212.8,213.38],["of",213.38,213.62],["our",213.62,213.82],["school,",213.82,214.26],["and",214.66,215.22],["of",215.22,215.4],["the",215.4,215.52],["very",215.52,215.82],["good",215.82,216.12]]},{"start":216.12,"end":222.38,"text":"results we achieve. Our teachers are all very committed to the school and at the end of","words":[["results",216.12,216.58],["we",216.58,216.9],["achieve.",216.9,217.32],["Our",218.3,218.46],["teachers",218.46,218.78],["are",218.78,219.06],["all",219.06,219.2],["very",219.